#: includes/class-oen-settings.php:87
msgid "HMAC secret for webhook signature verification (OenPay-Signature header). Filled in automatically when the webhook is registered; leave empty to skip signature checks for checkout events (refund events always require it)."
msgstr "驗證 Webhook 簽章（OenPay-Signature header）用的密鑰。註冊 Webhook 時會自動填入；留空時不檢查付款事件的簽章（退款事件一律需要）。"

#: includes/class-oen-settings.php:93
msgid "Re-register webhook"
msgstr "重新註冊 Webhook"

#: includes/class-oen-settings.php:94
msgid "Re-register the OEN webhook on save (refreshes the URL and signing secret)."
msgstr "儲存時重新註冊 OEN Webhook（更新通知網址與簽章密鑰）。"

#: includes/class-oen-settings.php:95
msgid "Tick this and save to (re)create the webhook on OEN. The plugin registers automatically on first save; use this after changing your site URL, MerchantID, or environment."
msgstr "勾選後儲存，會重新向 OEN 註冊 Webhook（同一網址會沿用既有的 Webhook，並換新簽章密鑰）。外掛在第一次儲存時會自動註冊；變更網站網址、商店代碼或環境後，請使用這個選項。"

